1
00:00:00,083 --> 00:00:01,335
- Lee Hyesung!
- Hyesung!

2
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:02,729
[16 years ago, "My Crazy
Family" shooting set]

3
00:00:02,753 --> 00:00:05,797
Soobin, where did you
last see him?

4
00:00:05,923 --> 00:00:08,008
We were playing

5
00:00:08,133 --> 00:00:10,177
hide and seek

6
00:00:11,887 --> 00:00:13,114
but I don't remember
where it was

7
00:00:13,138 --> 00:00:13,805
Hyesung!

8
00:00:13,931 --> 00:00:17,059
Okay, stop crying
and let's go find him

9
00:00:18,852 --> 00:00:21,396
- Lee Hyesung!
- Hyesung!

10
00:00:21,521 --> 00:00:23,607
- Lee Hyesung!
- Hyesung! Lee Hyesung!

11
00:00:23,732 --> 00:00:25,400
Anybody there?

12
00:00:27,569 --> 00:00:29,738
Anybody?

13
00:00:29,863 --> 00:00:31,949
Hyesung!

14
00:00:32,074 --> 00:00:34,159
Please help me!

15
00:00:34,284 --> 00:00:36,328
Hyesung!

16
00:00:36,453 --> 00:00:39,331
Help me! Anybody there?

17
00:00:39,456 --> 00:00:41,291
Help!

18
00:00:41,416 --> 00:00:42,960
Help me!

19
00:00:44,253 --> 00:00:45,671
Hyesung, are you
in there?

20
00:00:51,176 --> 00:00:52,052
The door is locked

21
00:00:52,177 --> 00:00:54,263
Wait a minute
I'll bring someone

22
00:00:54,388 --> 00:00:55,430
No

23
00:00:55,555 --> 00:00:57,266
Don't go, please

24
00:00:58,767 --> 00:01:00,269
Okay, got it

25
00:01:00,394 --> 00:01:02,020
I'll stay here

26
00:01:02,145 --> 00:01:04,525
I can't breathe here
I feel I'm dying

27
00:01:04,609 --> 00:01:05,983
I'm scared

28
00:01:06,108 --> 00:01:08,819
Take a deep breath

29
00:01:12,823 --> 00:01:15,325
It's okay, I'm here for you

30
00:01:17,661 --> 00:01:19,871
I'll stay here with you
